#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:2
msgid "DMCA takedown policy"
msgstr "DMCA 下架政策"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"These are the guidelines that Read the Docs follows when handling DMCA "
"takedown requests and takedown counter requests. If you are a copyright "
"holder wishing to submit a takedown request, or an author that has been "
"notified of a takedown request, please familiarize yourself with `our "
"process`__. You will be asked to confirm that you have reviewed information "
"if you submit a request or counter request."
msgstr ""
"以下是 Read the Docs 在处理 DMCA "
"下架请求和下架反通知请求时遵循的准则。若你是希望提交下架请求的版权所有者，或是收到下架请求通知的作者，请熟悉 `our process`__ "
"。提交请求或反通知请求时，你会被要求确认已阅读相关信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:13
msgid ""
"We aim to keep this entire process as transparent as possible. Our process "
"is modeled after `GitHub's DMCA takedown process`__, which we appreciate for"
" its focus on transparency and fairness. All requests and counter requests "
"will be posted to this page below, in the `Request Archive`_. These requests"
" will be redacted to remove all identifying information, except for Read the"
" Docs user and project names."
msgstr ""
"我们的目标是让整个流程尽可能透明。本流程参照 `GitHub's DMCA takedown process`__ "
"制定，我们赞赏其对透明与公正的注重。所有请求和反通知请求都会发布在本页下方的 `Request Archive`_ "
"中。这些请求会做删节处理以移除所有身份信息，但保留 Read the Docs 用户名和项目名。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:23
msgid "Takedown process"
msgstr "下架流程"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:25
msgid ""
"Here are the steps the Read the Docs will follow in the takedown request "
"process:"
msgstr "Read the Docs 在下架请求流程中将遵循以下步骤："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:27
msgid "Copyright holder submits a request"
msgstr "版权所有者提交请求"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:28
msgid ""
"This request, if valid, will be posted publicly on this page, `down "
"below`__. The author affected by the takedown request will be notified with "
"a link to the takedown request."
msgstr "该请求若有效，将公开发布在本页 `down below`__ 。受下架请求影响的作者会收到通知，并附上下架请求的链接。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:32
msgid ""
"For more information on submitting a takedown request, see: `Submitting a "
"Request`_"
msgstr "有关提交下架请求的更多信息，参见：`Submitting a Request`_"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:37
msgid "Author is contacted"
msgstr "联系作者"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:38
msgid ""
"The author of the content in question will be asked to make changes to the "
"content specified in the takedown request. The author will have 24 hours to "
"make these changes. The copyright holder will be notified if and when this "
"process begins"
msgstr "相关内容的作者会被要求对下架请求中指定的内容作出修改。作者有 24 小时完成这些修改。此流程开始时及进行过程中都会通知版权所有者"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:43
msgid "Author acknowledges changes have been made"
msgstr "作者确认已完成修改"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:44
msgid ""
"The author must notify Read the Docs that changes have been made within 24 "
"hours of receiving a takedown request. If the author does not respond to "
"this request, the default action will be to disable the Read the Docs "
"project and remove any hosted versions"
msgstr ""
"作者必须在收到下架请求后 24 小时内通知 Read the Docs 已完成修改。若作者未响应此请求，默认处理将是停用该 Read the Docs "
"项目并移除任何已托管的版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:49
msgid "Copyright holder review"
msgstr "版权所有者审查"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:50
msgid ""
"If the author has made changes, the copyright holder will be notified of "
"these changes. If the changes are sufficient, no further action is required,"
" though copyright holders are welcome to submit a formal retraction. If the "
"changes are not sufficient, the author's changes can be rejected. If the "
"takedown request requires alteration, a new request must be submitted.  If "
"Read the Docs does not receive a review response from the copyright holder "
"within 2 weeks, the default action at this step is to assume the takedown "
"request has been retracted."
msgstr ""
"若作者已作出修改，版权所有者会收到这些修改的通知。若修改充分，则无需进一步操作，不过版权所有者也欢迎提交正式撤回。若修改不充分，作者的修改可被驳回。若下架请求需要变更，必须重新提交请求。若"
" Read the Docs 在 2 周内未收到版权所有者的审查回应，此步骤的默认处理是视为下架请求已被撤回。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:59
msgid "Content may be disabled"
msgstr "内容可能被停用"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:60
msgid ""
"If the author does not respond to a request for changes, or if the copyright"
" holder has rejected the author's changes during the review process, the "
"documentation project in question will be disabled."
msgstr "若作者未响应修改请求，或版权所有者在审查过程中驳回了作者的修改，相关文档项目将被停用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:64
msgid "Author submits a counter request"
msgstr "作者提交反通知请求"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:65
msgid ""
"If the author believes their content was disabled as a result of a mistake, "
"a counter request may be submitted. It would be advised that authors seek "
"legal council before continuing. If the submitted counter request is "
"sufficiently detailed, this counter will also be added to `this page`__. The"
" copyright holder will be notified, with a link to this counter request."
msgstr ""
"若作者认为其内容因错误而被停用，可提交反通知请求。建议作者在继续前寻求法律顾问意见。若提交的反通知请求足够详尽，也会添加到 `this page`__ "
"。版权所有者会收到通知，并附上该反通知请求的链接。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:72
msgid ""
"For more information on submitting a counter request, see: `Submitting a "
"Counter`_"
msgstr "有关提交反通知请求的更多信息，参见：`Submitting a Counter`_"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:77
msgid "Copyright holder may file legal action"
msgstr "版权所有者可提起法律行动"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:78
msgid ""
"At this point, if the copyright holder wishes to keep the offending content "
"disabled, the copyright holder must file for legal action ordering the "
"author refrain from infringing activities on Read the Docs. The copyright "
"holder will have 2 weeks to supply Read the Docs with a copy of a valid "
"legal complaint against the author. The default action here, if the "
"copyright holder does not respond to this request, is to re-enable the "
"author's project."
msgstr ""
"此时，若版权所有者希望维持违规内容被停用，必须提起法律行动，要求作者停止在 Read the Docs 上的侵权活动。版权所有者有 2 周时间向 "
"Read the Docs 提供一份针对该作者的有效法律 complaint 副本。此处若版权所有者未响应此请求，默认处理是重新启用作者的项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:87
msgid "Submitting a request"
msgstr "提交请求"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:89
msgid "Your request must:"
msgstr "你的请求必须："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:91
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:121
msgid "Acknowledge this process"
msgstr "确认知悉本流程"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:92
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:122
msgid ""
"You must first acknowledge you are familiar with our DMCA takedown request "
"process. If you do not acknowledge that you are familiar with our process, "
"you will be instructed to review this information."
msgstr "你必须先确认自己熟悉我们的 DMCA 下架请求流程。若未确认熟悉该流程，我们将要求你阅读此信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:96
msgid "Identify the infringing content"
msgstr "指明侵权内容"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:97
msgid ""
"You should list URLs to each piece of infringing content. If you allege that"
" the entire project is infringing on copyrights you hold, please specify the"
" entire project as infringing."
msgstr "你应列出每一处侵权内容的 URL。若你主张整个项目侵犯你持有的版权，请将整个项目指定为侵权。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:101
msgid "Identify infringement resolution"
msgstr "指明侵权处理方式"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:102
msgid ""
"You will need to specify what a user must do in order to avoid having the "
"rest of their content disabled. Be as specific as possible with this. "
"Specify if this means adding attribution, identify specific files or content"
" that should be removed, or if you allege the entire project is infringing, "
"your should be specific as to why it is infringing."
msgstr "你需要说明用户必须做什么才能避免其余内容被停用。请尽可能具体：说明是添加署名、指出应移除的具体文件或内容，或若你主张整个项目侵权，则具体说明其侵权原因。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:108
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:129
msgid "Include your contact information"
msgstr "附上你的联系信息"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:109
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:130
msgid "Include your name, email, physical address, and phone number."
msgstr "请附上你的姓名、邮箱、实际地址和电话号码。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:111
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:132
msgid "Include your signature"
msgstr "附上你的签名"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:112
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:133
msgid "This can be a physical or electronic signature."
msgstr "可以是手写签名或电子签名。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:114
msgid ""
"Please complete this :download:`takedown request template <../_static/dmca"
"/takedown-template.txt>` and send it to: support@readthedocs.com"
msgstr ""
"请填写此 :download:`下架请求模板 <../_static/dmca/takedown-template.txt>` "
"并发送至：support@readthedocs.com"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:117
msgid "Submitting a counter"
msgstr "提交反通知"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:119
msgid "Your counter request must:"
msgstr "你的反通知请求必须："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:126
msgid "Identify the infringing content that was removed"
msgstr "指明被移除的侵权内容"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:127
msgid "Specify URLs in the original takedown request that you wish to challenge."
msgstr "指定原下架请求中你希望质疑的 URL。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:135
msgid "Requests can be submitted to: support@readthedocs.com"
msgstr "请求可提交至：support@readthedocs.com"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:138
msgid "Request archive"
msgstr "请求归档"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:140
msgid ""
"For better transparency into copyright ownership and the DMCA takedown "
"process, Read the Docs maintains this archive of previous DMCA takedown "
"requests. This is modeled after `GitHub's DMCA archive`__."
msgstr ""
"为更好地展示版权归属和 DMCA 下架流程的透明度，Read the Docs 维护此过往 DMCA 下架请求归档。它参照 `GitHub's DMCA"
" archive`__ 制定。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/index.rst:146
msgid "The following DMCA takedown requests have been submitted:"
msgstr "已提交以下 DMCA 下架请求："

